:: Ben Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> if he wants to hang out at the park and he agrees, <span style="color:Yellow">though you notice a touch of nervousness in his voice and question it.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“N- no, it’s fine. Really.”</span> He says, scratching his cheek, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I’m just more of an indoor kid, if that wasn’t obvious. If I stay outside too long, I’m liable to get sunburnt or get all sweaty and gross or…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> pauses and turns bright red, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“S- sorry! I don’t mean I don’t want to hang out with you or anything! The park will be great! More than great!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Now <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> seems more worried that he soured your opinion of him by stating his preference for indoor activities.</span><br>

