<div id="choice">
	<<link "You’ll show him how to have fun outside<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You laugh and put your arm on his shoulders to reassure him, telling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> that you’ll show him just how fun playing outside can be. <span style="color:LightGreen">By the time you’re done, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> won’t want to go back inside.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> replies nervously, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“P… perfect! Haha…”</span> He laughs nervously as you lead him towards the park. Though, despite his nerves, he does seem excited to hang out with you, no matter the location.<br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Ben Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "You won’t do anything too crazy<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You smile and put your arm on his shoulder, telling him that you won’t do anything too crazy or exhausting. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Thank goodness.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Ben</span> sighs in relief, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I can barely survive gym class. It’s not like I don’t enjoy having fun, it’s just… I know my strengths – or lack thereof. But… I- I’ll try not to be such a buzzkill.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He gives you a hopeful smile as the two of you walk towards the park.</span> <br>
        <br>
